Test: sprintf() function
--------------------------------------
  sprintf("Number: %%d", 42): Number: 42
  sprintf("Float: %%.2f", 3.14159): Float: 3.14
  sprintf("String: %%s", "hello"): String: hello
  sprintf("Multiple: %%d %%s %%.1f", 10, "test", 2.5): Multiple: 10 test 2.5
  sprintf("Width: %%10d", 42): Width:         42
  sprintf("Precision: %%.5f", 1.23456789): Precision: 1.23457
  sprintf("Percent: %%%%"): Percent: %
